<title>USA: Plymouth Dist, Mich. won by William R. Hough.</title>
<headline>Plymouth Dist, Mich. won by William R. Hough.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>William R. Hough said it won $7.355 million of Plymouth District Library, Mich., 1996 library facility general obligation bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.49 percent.</p>
</text>
